{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國音樂盛事《2026 MAMA AWARDS》將於下月20至21日在日本大阪京瓷巨蛋舉行，主辦單位今日公布今年新增《MAMA》形象大使一職，並宣布由男神朴寶劍擔任大使及主持人。</p><p>朴寶劍過去多次為《MAMA》擔任主持人，今年他將肩負大使一職。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:25.474743+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:54:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:24.304681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:24.304681+00:00","content_hash":"998bb5f04f2e1b6cfc58b86e64ee5b1ab621b47d921068f98ce363285d0804f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}